  "description": "The meme relies on dark humor — humor derived from morbid, taboo, or potentially offensive subjects — to create its effect. Understanding that the joke is based on a dangerous scenario (stepping on a landmine) and then subverting it with absurdity (not triggering it due to weight) requires knowledge of dark humor conventions.",
